<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>XEON | Next-Gen Crypto</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #050505;
            --text-color: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #888888;
            --accent-color: #00ffcc;
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* --- Ambient 3D Glow Effects --- */
        .glow-1 {
            position: absolute;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,255,204,0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            top: -100px;
            left: -100px;
            z-index: -1;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .glow-2 {
            position: absolute;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,150,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            top: 40%;
            right: -100px;
            z-index: -1;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        /* --- Navigation --- */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 25px 5%;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            top: 0;
            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .logo span { color: var(--accent-color); }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 400;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 5%;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Fake 3D Chrome Shape (CSS only) */
        .chrome-shape {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #222 0%, #555 50%, #111 100%);
            border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%;
            position: absolute;
            top: 15%;
            z-index: -1;
            filter: blur(20px);
            opacity: 0.5;
            animation: morph 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes morph {
            0%, 100% { border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%; transform: rotate(0deg); }
            50% { border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%; transform: rotate(10deg); }
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 65px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, #888);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Search Bar Style Button */
        .search-bar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 10px 10px 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
        }

        .search-bar input {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            outline: none;
            flex: 1;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .search-bar button {
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .search-bar button:hover {
            background: var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* --- Grid Section (Glass Cards) --- */
        .section {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            transition: 0.4s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .glass-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent 50%);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .glass-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .glass-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

        .glass-card h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .glass-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .highlight { color: var(--accent-color); font-weight: 600; }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 40px; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .search-bar { flex-direction: column; border-radius: 20px; background: transparent; border: none; }
            .search-bar input { display: none; }
            .search-bar button { width: 100%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="glow-1"></div>
    <div class="glow-2"></div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">XE<span>O</span>N</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#about">Overview</a>
            <a href="#howitworks">Mechanics</a>
            <a href="#tokenomics">Tokenomics</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="chrome-shape"></div>
        <h1>The Future of <br><span>Honest Crypto.</span></h1>
        <p>No fake promises. No hidden wallets. Just a transparent smart contract designed to reward real holders with real BNB.</p>
        
        <!-- Replaced Buy Button with a Search-style Status Button -->
        <div class="search-bar">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Status: Launching Soon..." readonly>
            <button>Notify Me</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- About / Mechanics -->
    <section id="howitworks" class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="glass-card">
                <h3>01. Auto BNB Tax</h3>
                <p>Every transaction incurs a small tax. The smart contract automatically converts this tax into real BNB and stores it in a reward pool.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <h3>02. 7-Day Loyalty</h3>
                <p>To claim your share, you must stake your XEON tokens for a minimum of 7 days. This ensures only real supporters get rewarded.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <h3>03. Anti-Whale System</h3>
                <p>Large trades (over 0.5% of supply) are taxed at <span class="highlight">5%</span> instead of 3%. This protects small holders from market manipulation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tokenomics -->
    <section id="tokenomics" class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Tokenomics</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="glass-card">
                <h3>Total Supply</h3>
                <p><span class="highlight">100,000,000 XEON</span> — Fixed forever. No minting.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <h3>Reward Split</h3>
                <p><span class="highlight">40%</span> Top 3 Stakers<br><span class="highlight">40%</span> All Holders<br><span class="highlight">20%</span> Project Development</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="logo" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">XE<span>O</span>N</div>
        <p>100% Transparent. 100% Community Driven.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;">&copy; 2024 XEON. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>